        "VersionDescription": "Introduced interpolation of reference surface heights when computing freeboard heights. In previous releases, a static value of the 10 km reference surface was used to compute freeboard heights. In v7, reference surface heights are interpolated (if neighboring reference surfaces are available) to the freeboard height location before freeboard height computation; Introduced option to include height",
